  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media Outlets for Trustworthy Information and Objective News (MOTION)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID supports independent media outlets in the region for their valuable public service: providing objective and accurate news and information to citizens about what is happening on the ground. This work counters attempts by undemocratic actors to control the information space, builds communities resilience to information manipulation, and fosters connections between independent media outlets, civil society organizations, and marginalized communities.</narrative>
  </description>
